    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_pass" kindref="compound">Pass</ref> to replace calls to ifuncs with indirect calls. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This could be used to support ifunc on systems where the program loader does not natively support it. <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_constant" kindref="compound">Constant</ref> initializer uses of ifuncs are not handled. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
